      "edition": "Wednesday 23 September",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "COACHING ROLE",
          "heading": "England women hire Shaun Edwards as defence consultant for WXV series",
          "body": "England women have secured the services of legendary defence guru Shaun Edwards in a consultancy role for the remainder of the WXV Global Series. The Red Roses move follows Edwards' departure from the France men’s setup in June, with head coach John Mitchell describing his credentials as “exceptional” at the highest level. Edwards will work alongside Sarah Hunter ahead of Saturday’s test against New Zealand. It marks the first time the former Wales coach has worked within the women’s international game."
        },
