        {
          "kicker": "Broadcast rights",
          "heading": "Scotland Women await official Sky Sports confirmation for inaugural 2027 Lions tour",
          "body": "Scotland Women are still awaiting official confirmation that Sky Sports has secured the broadcast rights for the inaugural 2027 British & Irish Lions tour. Despite reports last week that an agreement was imminent, the Lions board has offered no further update today. The deal is crucial for the visibility of the New Zealand series, which remains a key target for the national squad following Saturday’s 14-66 WXV defeat by the Black Ferns. The Scots, featuring two-try scorer Evie Gallagher, now refocus for Australia this weekend."
        },
