          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Dewi Lake named Gloucester captain with Jac Morgan serving as deputy",
          "body": "Wales hooker Dewi Lake has been appointed Gloucester captain for the 2026/27 season, with fellow Welsh international Jac Morgan named among the club’s vice-captains. The duo, who previously led Wales as co-captains during the 2023 World Cup, have reunited at Kingsholm following their departure from the Ospreys. Gloucester head coach George Skivington confirmed the decision followed input from the playing group, noting that “Dewi’s leadership experience is there for everyone to see” ahead of their upcoming league campaign."
