      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Sevens Success",
          "heading": "Argentina men and women celebrate historic double gold in Rosario games",
          "body": "Argentina’s rugby sevens programmes cemented their status as the continent's premier force by securing a golden double at the Juegos Suramericanos in Rosario. The men’s team claimed victory with a 17–7 result over Chile, while Las Yaguaretés ended Brazil’s decade-long dominance with a 35–5 win against Colombia. These clinical performances ensure both sides have officially locked in their automatic qualification for the 2027 Pan American Games, maintaining the country's momentum on the international stage."
        },
