      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Andre Esterhuizen named captain as Springboks make 13 changes for Australia",
          "body": "Rassie Erasmus has rung the changes for Sunday’s Test in Perth, handing Andre Esterhuizen the captaincy in an overhauled Springbok starting XV. The centre leads a side featuring 13 alterations from the team that recently finished their series against the All Blacks. Only lock Eben Etzebeth and winger Ethan Hooker retain their spots. Australia’s forwards coach Tom Donnelly admits the hosts face a physical test, noting, “We know what’s coming” as they look to build on their improving set-piece performance."
        },
